Class armor sets from the [[Plane of Fear]] and [[Plane of Hate]] drop differently than they did in classic Everquest.  Instead of a single type of mob dropping every armor piece for a specific class, most planar mobs can drop a single armor piece from a group of classes.  The result is that every class needs to kill many different enemies across Fear and Hate to collect a full set, rather than trying to farm all their drops from a single type of enemy in only one Plane.

